---
description: Contract and chain integration rules.
globs: ["**/*.sol", "**/contracts/**", "**/*contract*.ts", "**/*deployment*.json"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Assert chain ID before resolving a deployment.
- Use typed ABIs and clients from the selected release.
- Verify runtime code and proxy implementation for security-critical paths.
- Simulate state-changing calls before sending.
- Add positive, failure, chain-mismatch, and authority-boundary tests.
- Do not edit generated ABI/deployment files directly.
